msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.describe"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.describe.describe:1 of
msgid "Generate descriptive statistics."
msgstr "生成描述性统计。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.describe.describe:3 of
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Computes count, mean, std, min, percentiles, and max for each eligible "
"column.  The result is a long-format LiteFrame with a ``statistic`` "
"column identifying the statistic and one column per data column.  If a "
"data column is already named ``\"statistic\"``, the index column is "
"suffixed (``\"statistic_1\"``, ``\"statistic_2\"``, …)."
msgstr ""
"长格式帧，列为 ``[\"statistic\", {col_1}, ...]``。如果数据列已名为 ``\""
"statistic\"``，索引列将添加后缀（``\"statistic_1\"``、``\"statistic_2\"``"
"、...）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.describe.describe of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.describe.describe:9 of
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Percentiles to compute, in ``[0, 1]``.  Must be unique and exclude 0 and "
"1 (covered by min/max).  Unsorted input is silently sorted ascending "
"(matching pandas)."
msgstr ""
"要计算的分位数，取值范围为 ``[0, 1]``。必须升序排列、唯一，且不包含 0 和 "
"1（由 min/max 覆盖）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.describe.describe:13 of
msgid ""
"If True, only numeric columns are described.  If False, both numeric and "
"datetime columns are included.  For datetime columns, ``count``, "
"``mean``, and ``std`` emit ``NaT`` (polars cannot evaluate mean/std on "
"Datetime, and an integer count cannot fit a datetime type); ``min``, "
"percentiles, and ``max`` pass through as timestamps.  This diverges from "
"pandas, which computes a real Timestamp mean and an integer count."
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.reduction.describe.describe of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

